 "notes": [
  "Commodity Insights is renamed 'Energy' in this release (code CI).",
  "Exhibit 1 prints 'Other income, net' as a bracketed number (income) -> oth_inc positive.",
  "Corporate unallocated expense in the segment exhibit includes the $270 million gain on disposition (three and twelve months), so corp is negative (a credit) in Q4; corp_nongaap uses OP add-back sign (gain removed -> negative).",
  "seg_other.eq_deal_amort (extra key) = deal-related amortization within equity in income of unconsolidated subsidiaries.",
  "Balance sheet: assets / liabilities held for sale relate to the Enterprise Data Management and thinkFolio divestitures (Market Intelligence) and the Centennial, Colorado facility.",
  "Capex and NCI distributions recorded as positive costs; fcf_items as printed.",
  "2026 outlook (this release) is adjusted only, except reported revenue growth and capex; GAAP guidance deferred until the Mobility spin. Guidance assumes Mobility contributes for the full year. Adjusted free cash flow excluding certain items expected to grow mid-single digits.",
  "Annual record from the twelve-month column of the Q4-2025 release.",
  "Exhibit 1 'Expenses' (9,159) excludes gain on dispositions (273) and equity in income (28); segment exhibit 'Total expenses' (8,858) nets both.",
  "Exhibit 5 adjusted net income prints only an aggregate 'Non-GAAP adjustments' line (131 after tax, $0.43/share). Pre-tax: operating 142, interest -26 (premium amortization benefit) = 116; tax on non-GAAP adjustments -15 (printed).",
  "RELEASE DOES NOT TIE: footnote items after tax sum to 129 (computed) vs 131 printed; footnote pre-tax items sum to 115 vs 116 (MI 92 vs 91, Ratings 59 vs 60, Energy 20 vs 21 printed). Hence start_ni + items_net + amort_net = 5,438 vs adjusted NI 5,441 printed (check_rec flags 3.0). Published numbers kept.",
  "Mobility twelve-month footnote omits the $1 million acquisition-related cost shown in the nine-month (Q3) footnote; footnote items (7+15-4-3 = 15) tie to printed 15.",
  "Deal-related amortization pre-tax 1,109 = segments 1,064 + corporate 4 + equity-method 41; tax 272; after tax 838.",
  "Exhibit 5 prints GAAP effective tax rate 22.6% and adjusted 22.3% for 2025."
 ],
